# Theme

Tokens live in `src/styles/global.css`. No `tailwind.config.js` — Tailwind v4 is CSS-first. Palette is sampled from the `@chstr.runclub` Instagram profile picture (green-black ink `#0b1715`, white, lime dot `#c5d84a` — lime is an estimate from a 100px JPEG; refine from the original logo). Set once in `global.css`, referenced only by token — never raw hex in components.

## Vibe

Community, joy, inclusive, social. Bold type, thick ink outlines, bubble/pill shapes and sticker-style cards over a clean ink + lime + white base. Content stays legible first (WCAG AA — `accessibility.mdc`).

## Colour roles (shadcn-style token names)

| Role | Token |
|---|---|
| Brand fill | `--primary` / `--primary-foreground` |
| Accent (panel dividers, highlights) | `--accent` / `--accent-foreground` |
| Surface | `--card` / `--background` |
| Muted background | `--muted` |
| Border | `--border` |
| Text | `--foreground` |
| Secondary text | `--muted-foreground` |
| Focus | `--ring` |
| Error | `--destructive` + `--destructive-foreground` |
| Success | `--success` + `--success-foreground` |

Prefer token utilities over raw hex. Muted status surfaces: `bg-destructive/10`, `bg-success/10`.

## Spacing

`--spacing: 0.25rem` (4px base). Page gutter 24 (`p-6`), section gap 24+ (`gap-6`), card padding 16 (`p-4`), inline gap 8 (`gap-2`).

## Home hero: collage

The landing hero is a full-viewport mosaic (`HeroCollage.astro`): six columns (four on phones) of tiles drifting up and down at different speeds, each column's tiles repeated twice for a seamless CSS loop, behind a radial ink scrim, with the logo plate centred and clean, then the H1, the one-line pitch, the when/where/cost chips and two CTAs. Motion is CSS only (`global.css`: `col-drift`, `tile-in`, `logo-pop`, `hero-rise`, `marquee`, `bubble-float`) and switches off under `prefers-reduced-motion`. The collage is decorative: tiles use `alt=""`, and the same facts are real text in the page.

Supporting sections reuse the same language: ticker bands (`TickerBand`), step cards (`MondayPlan`), activity cards, a masonry gallery (`GalleryMosaic`), a merch strip, FAQ teaser, waiver panel and social band. Inner pages open with `PageBanner` (H1 + three tilted tiles).

## Pictures: one manifest

Every picture comes from `src/data/Gallery/gallery-tiles.ts` (`tiles`, `heroColumns`, `galleryTiles`). The shipped tiles are original illustrations in the bubble/cartoon style, not photos. To use real photos: add the file to `src/assets/gallery/` with a descriptive hyphenated name, import it in the manifest, replace the entry and write a real `alt` (who and what is in the picture). Astro makes AVIF/WebP at build. Keep hero tiles small in the collage (`width={360}`) and let `check:site` police sizes.

## Layout signature

Vertical panel dividers between page sections, revealed on scroll. One shared `PanelDivider` component in `features/site-shell`; every page section reuses it.

## Hit area

Interactive controls: `min-h-10` (40px). Adjacent hit areas must not overlap.

## Motion

- Press scale: `active:scale-[0.96]`
- Timing: `cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1)`
- Never `transition: all` — list properties
- Honour `prefers-reduced-motion` — reveals render in their final state when set
- Enter: `opacity` + `translateY(12px)`, stagger ~100ms
- Exit: subtler and shorter than enter
- Skip enter animation on first paint above the fold — animate on scroll into view
- Animations stay interruptible

## Media and touch

- `tabular-nums` on prices and counts
- `touch-action: manipulation` on interactive controls
- `overscroll-behavior: contain` inside overlays and dialogs

## Typography

Logo wordmark: heavy uppercase geometric sans, tight tracking, lime full stop, small widely-tracked `RUN & SOCIAL` beneath. Headings: Montserrat ExtraBold uppercase. Body: Inter. Both self-hosted via `@fontsource-variable/*`. The wordmark is HTML (`Logo.astro`), not an SVG `<img>`, so it uses the page font. `antialiased` on `<html>`. `text-balance` on headings, `text-pretty` on body.
